# UI / Flask

- Templates live under `ui/templates/`; shared chrome in `_*.html` partials. New nav links need real `@app.get` routes or `url_for` BuildError → 500.
- Anonymous HTML cache: `ui/page_cache.py` + nginx `proxy_cache`. Prefer cache-friendly anonymous pages; do not break session/admin bypass.
- Media is expensive on the gunicorn worker: `/media/object` and `/media/proxy` must keep AI-bot 403 (nginx + Flask). Do not remove without a CDN/offload plan.
- Feedback: modal `_feedback_modal.html`, FAB, listing «Консультация»; admin inbox `/admin/feedback`. Messenger URLs from env (`FEEDBACK_*`); stubs OK until real chats are set.
- Static cache-bust with `?v=` on CSS/JS when shipping visual changes.
- Match existing visual tokens (`--bg`, `--accent` in `style.css`); avoid unrelated redesign unless asked.
